~ start
Archivist: Welcome, Architect. I am the Archivist of this castle. [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/archivist_normal.png]
Archivist: I do not need sight to read a prophecy. But the magic must speak clearly.
Archivist: My screen reader cannot make sense of this orb. It just says: "Visual Prophecy underscore Final Magic".
: You activate your power to hear what she hears. [#activate_shader]
: The world fades to dark, and the Mirror's interface appears. [#show_debug] [#minigame_menu]
=> END

~ fail_reaction
Archivist: No... the screen reader is still reading nonsense. I cannot see the prophecy.
=> END

~ win_reaction
Archivist: "A dragon flying over a burning castle"... I see it perfectly now! [#deactivate_shader] 
Archivist: Symbols and words provide clarity, no matter how the world is perceived. [#close_minigame] [#show_dragon]
Archivist: It is Kalipso! The great dragon is returning! You must hurry!
=> END

~ already_helped
Archivist: Thank you for giving words to the magic, Architect. 
=> END